  "description": "<div>\r\n<p>Jennifer Benjamin Art Studio is an artistic powerhouse rooted in empowerment, spirituality, and creativity. We inspire through art that blends beauty with deeper meaning, reminding individuals of their innate power to create and transform their lives. Our works are adored by open-minded, creative women who value connection, self-expression, and personal growth.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Join and share the movement.</p>\r\n<p>Our brand&rsquo;s soul is infused with every piece of art we create. We combine artistry with a purpose, designing not only visually stunning pieces but art that uplifts, heals, and reminds people of their inner strength. Our hand-embellished, kintsugi-inspired canvas prints and cultural portraits resonate deeply with our audience, offering something truly special and unique to collectors. Affiliates have the opportunity to share this distinctive brand story and connect with a vibrant community that values personal growth, spirituality, and fine art.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Commission Plan</strong></p>\r\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;<strong>10% commission</strong> on sales up to $299.</p>\r\n<p>&bull; <strong>20% commission</strong> on sales $300 and more.</p>\r\n<p>&bull; <strong>20% commission</strong> on all canvas prints.</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"></p>\r\n</div>",
